cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Data Washing Machine Classic + CODA Comparator"
message: >-
  Cite the upstream Data Washing Machine refactor for the original DWM
  algorithm. Cite this repository if you use the CODA/TahaComparator-CX
  comparator, cleaned Colab bundle, benchmark tooling, data capture, or local
  documentation.
authors:
  - name: "Taha Mohammed"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic"
license-url: "https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic/blob/main/LICENSE"
date-released: "2026-03-30"
abstract: >-
  Fork of dwm-refactor-v1 with a cleaned runnable Colab bundle, comparator
  benchmark tooling, data-capture/reporting additions, and CODA
  (Context-Driven Adaptive Comparator), implemented as TahaComparator-CX.
  CODA combines frequency-derived token roles, self-weighted evidence scoring,
  and ephemeral unresolved-pool context inside the DWM peel-off pipeline.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "dwm-refactor-v1 (Data Washing Machine refactor)"
    repository-code: "https://bitbucket.org/oysterer/dwm-refactor-v1"
    abstract: "Upstream Python refactor of the Data Washing Machine; cite as the original implementation."
